                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17868344" author="chillinger" created="Wed, 24 Jul 2024 11:54:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This Entry from &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/289e954db5a2cd4577a8ecd0437ef2f7353cbf55/zeppelin-zengine/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/notebook/scheduler/CronJob.java#L52&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;zeppelin-zengine/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/notebook/scheduler/CronJob.java&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;

&#160; &#160; List&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; rolesList = GSON.fromJson(roles, ArrayList.class);
&#160; &#160; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (roles == &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;) {
&#160; &#160; &#160; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;.roles = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; HashSet&amp;lt;&amp;gt;();
&#160; &#160; } &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; {
&#160; &#160; &#160; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;.roles = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; HashSet&amp;lt;&amp;gt;(rolesList);
&#160; &#160; }
&#160; }



&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;need to be added to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/289e954db5a2cd4577a8ecd0437ef2f7353cbf55/zeppelin-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/service/NotebookService.java#L892&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;zeppelin-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/service/NotebookService.java&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17868854" author="chillinger" created="Fri, 26 Jul 2024 05:48:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I created a Fix for the Issue, please see PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4777&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[ZEPPELIN-6035] fix Cron setting for Notebook by johannesschillinger-dm &#183; Pull Request #4777 &#183; apache/zeppelin (github.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17869418" author="reamer" created="Mon, 29 Jul 2024 17:56:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Closed via &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4777&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4777&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17869419" author="reamer" created="Mon, 29 Jul 2024 18:00:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have also pushed the changes to branch-0.11. However, I don&apos;t know whether the changes will already be included in release 0.11.2. The change should be included in 0.11.3.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
